      "content": "When everything feels like a relentless system crash, it's easy to feel hopeless about any possibility of recovery. However, instead of viewing yourself as faulty code, perhaps you are encountering a complex bug that requires a different kind of debugging process. Consider seeking professional help; therapists are experts at helping people diagnose these deep-seated emotional issues and find workable solutions. You don't have to accept the \"unrecoverable\" diagnosis on your own.",
      "source": "target",
